msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Scrobbluje to, co ôglōndŏsz w Kodi, i synchronizuje twojã bibliotekã z Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Trakt Relay scrobbluje do Trakt filmy, ôdcinki, telewizyjã na żywo i nagrania, kere ôglōndŏsz w Kodi, i synchronizuje z niym twojã bibliotekã: kolekcyjã, status ôbejrzyniŏ, ôcyny i postymp ôdtwarzaniŏ, kożdy kerunek włōnczany w sztelōnkach. Po ôbejrzyniu pytŏ ô ôcynã, a jego menu kōntekstowe ôcyniŏ, dodŏwŏ do listy do ôbejrzyniŏ i zaczynŏ powtōrne ôglōndanie seriala. Niyudane scrobble sōm prōbowane zaś niyskorzij.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay to zmiyniōnŏ wersyjŏ script.trakt ôd Trakt.tv, Razzeee i jego wspōłautorōw."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt Relay niy je powiōnzany z Trakt ani przez Trakt popiyrany."

