msgstr "Wczytowanie ôcyn z Trakt"

msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "Ôglōndanie"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Dodatek Trakt tyż je włōnczōny. Ôba dodatki scrobblujōm i synchronizujōm z Trakt, tōż wszysko je robiōne dwa razy."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Ôstŏw ôba"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Zacznij powtōrne ôglōndanie"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Zaczōnć powtōrne ôglōndanie na Trakt? Twōj postymp zacznie sie ôd nowa, a wszyjske ôdcinki bydōm w Kodi ôznaczōne za niyôbejrzane."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Powtōrne ôglōndanie zaczōne"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Niy szło zaczōnć powtōrnygo ôglōndaniŏ"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Używej motywu OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Pokazuje czyrwōne logo Trakt, serca i farbã wyrōżniyniŏ, jak na og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "Niy szło zsynchronizować pozycyji: %i"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Twoje kōnto Trakt je zablokowane. Skōntaktuj sie z pōmocōm technicznōm Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Dosiōngniynto limit listy do ôbejrzyniŏ: %i"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Wybier, co synchronizować"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Ôtwiyrŏ sztelōnki synchronizacyje pokazowane po połōnczyniu z Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Synchronizuje, kej Kodi skōńczy skanowanie abo czyszczynie biblioteki. W inkszym raziy synchronizacyjŏ startuje ino wtedy, kej jã sōm zaczniesz, np. z menu kōntekstowego."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Powiadōmiŏ, kej synchronizacyjŏ po skanowaniu abo czyszczyniu biblioteki sie zaczynŏ i kōńczy."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Niy pokazuje powiadōmiyń ô synchronizacyji w czasie ôdtwarzaniŏ wideo."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Dopasowuje pozycyje bez ID IMDb, TMDB abo TVDB po tytule i roku przi scrobblowaniu i synchronizacyji. Nigdy niy je używane do ôznaczaniŏ pozycyji za niyôbejrzane ani do kasowaniŏ ôcyn."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Status ôbejrzyniŏ"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Z Trakt do Kodi: Kodi je zgodne z Trakt, razym z liczbōm ôdtworzyń i datami, a wszysko, co niy mŏ ôdtworzyń na Trakt, je ôznaczane za niyôbejrzane. Z Kodi do Trakt: pozycyje ôbejrzane w Kodi bez ôdtworzyniŏ na Trakt sōm dodŏwane do jego historyje. W ôbie strōny: kożdŏ strōna dostŏwŏ ôdtworzynia, kerych ji brakuje, a nic niy je ôznaczane za niyôbejrzane poza powtōrnym ôglōndaniym na Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Wyłōnczōne"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Z Trakt do Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Z Kodi do Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "W ôbie strōny"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Ôcyny"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Filmy, seriale i ôdcinki"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Z Trakt do Kodi: Kodi je zgodne z Trakt, a ôcyny, kerych Trakt niy mŏ, sōm kasowane w Kodi. Z Kodi do Trakt: ôcyny z Kodi sōm dodŏwane do Trakt i zastympujōm te, kere sie rōżniōm. W ôbie strōny: brakujōnce ôcyny sōm kopiowane w ôbie strōny, a kaj sie rōżniōm, ôstŏwŏ ôcyna z Trakt."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Pōnkty wznowiyniŏ z Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Kodi wznowiŏ tam, kaj pozycyjŏ je zapauzowanŏ na Trakt, np. na inkszym urzōndzyniu. Kej to je wyłōnczōne, ôdtwarzanie w Kodi dalij posyłŏ swōj postymp do Trakt."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Dodŏwanie"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Dodŏwanie i wyciepowanie"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Dodŏwanie: pozycyje z Kodi sōm dodŏwane do kolekcyje Trakt. Dodŏwanie i wyciepowanie: pozycyje w kolekcyji, kerych Kodi niy mŏ, sōm tyż z nij wyciepowane, razym z tymi z inkszych urzōndzyń abo aplikacyji."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Relay zawdy scrobbluje, kej je połōnczōny. Synchronizacyjŏ ôbejmuje to, czego niy scrobblowoł: inksze urzōndzynia, starszŏ historyjŏ."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Włōnczōne"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Status ôbejrzyniŏ niy je synchronizowany."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi je zgodne z Trakt, razym z liczbōm ôdtworzyń i datami. Wszysko, co niy mŏ ôdtworzyń na Trakt, je w Kodi ôznaczane za niyôbejrzane."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Pozycyje ôbejrzane w Kodi bez ôdtworzyniŏ na Trakt sōm dodŏwane do jego historyje. Kodi niy je zmiyniane."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Kożdŏ strōna dostŏwŏ ôdtworzynia, kerych ji brakuje, a nic niy je ôznaczane za niyôbejrzane poza powtōrnym ôglōndaniym na Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Ôcyny niy sōm synchronizowane."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Ôcyny w Kodi sōm zgodne z Trakt, a ôcyny, kerych Trakt niy mŏ, sōm kasowane w Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ôcyny z Kodi sōm dodŏwane do Trakt i zastympujōm te, kere sie rōżniōm. Kodi niy je zmiyniane."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Brakujōnce ôcyny sōm kopiowane w ôbie strōny. Kaj sie rōżniōm, ôstŏwŏ ôcyna z Trakt."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Kodi trzimie swoje włŏsne pōnkty wznowiyniŏ."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Kodi wznowiŏ tam, kaj pozycyjŏ je zapauzowanŏ na Trakt, np. na inkszym urzōndzyniu."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Synchronizacyjŏ startuje ino wtedy, kej jã sōm zaczniesz, np. z menu kōntekstowego."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Synchronizuje, kej Kodi skōńczy skanowanie abo czyszczynie biblioteki."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Spamiyntej i synchronizuj"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Ôznaczyć pozycyje (%i) w Kodi za niyôbejrzane, coby sie zgadzały z Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Skasować ôcyny (%i) w Kodi, coby sie zgadzały z Trakt?"
